Now I see the key structure. At the start of each opcode in the fast interpreter:
```c
p_org = p;
disable_emit = false;
emit_label(opcode);
```

Then in the switch statement, `disable_emit` can be set to `true` in certain cases. Let me look at where `disable_emit = true` is set in the block handling:

<｜｜DSML｜｜>
